OpenGrid
========

This repository began as a fork of phprs (https://github.com/yingkitw/phprs,
Apache License 2.0, see LICENSE). The original interpreter served as a
quarry for builtin behaviour and for test material; its last state in this
tree is tagged `legacy-core-last` (and the unmodified upstream as
`upstream-baseline`). The current interpreter (crates/vm, "grd-vm") and the
framework (crates/framework) are new code written for the OpenGrid dialect.

Test scripts harvested from the phprs test suite live under
crates/vm/tests/probes/legacy_* with PHP 8.4 output as the reference.
